[00:01.450]Last night I had a dream
[00:12.930]That I was on an endless run
[00:24.140]I wasn't tired, I wasn't scared
[00:32.210]I couldn't stop, but I didn't care
[00:40.380]I ran through the night, I ran through the rain
[00:51.540]I ran and ran 'til everything looked the same
[01:02.590]And it was then, I passed the lake
[01:10.230]At your reflection, I turned to ask
[01:17.590]Can anyone tell that I am lost?
[01:31.810]Can anyone tell that I am naked before you?
[01:42.460]That I am burning for you, oh, oh
[02:35.550]So, there you were and I knew it was over
[02:49.460]However beautiful, however mad
[02:57.320]Before I wake, I just had to ask
[03:04.750]Do you remember why you're here?
[03:19.130]Do you remember what
[03:26.520]What in the world were you after?
[03:29.740]Or were you running away somehow?
[03:42.300]I woke up both happy and sad
[03:53.900]A little sorr,y a little glad
